  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">56% of Nepali industries</strong> cite lack of skilled manpower as the primary barrier to AI adoption. This isn't a technology problem. It's a knowledge problem. Businesses in Kathmandu and across Nepal know AI can help them compete, but they don't know where to start.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    This guide bridges that gap. We provide practical, budget-conscious implementation strategies tailored for Nepal's market conditions. Whether you're a 10-person startup or a 500-person enterprise, you'll find a path forward.
  </p>
</div>

